	<<molested>>
	<<tentaclestart 6 8>>
<</if>>

<<statetentacles>>
You count $tentacles.active tentacles surrounding you.
<<underwater>><<effects>>
<<effectstentacles>>
<<tentacles>>
<<actionstentacles>>
<<if $tentacles.active lte ($tentacles.max / 2)>>
