		<<set $logprep to $logprep+" Deciding that I'd had enough I tried to swim away and free myself but I couldn't and the tentacles dragged me back and had their way with me until they were satisfied.">>
	<</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Lake Ruin Deep NonConsentacles]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Lake Pots [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $stress gte 10000>>
	<<passoutlake>>
<<else>>
/*<<set _r to $ruinpots.length/10>><<set $searchpot to random(_r)>>/* pick random pot from the 1st 10% */
<<set $searchpot to Math.round($rng/10)>>/* pick random pot from the 1st 10 */
<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "swarm">>/* 2% Should presence of swarms be separate from contents? */
	<<if $swarmdisable is "f">>
		You reach inside one of the pots. Swarms of small fish surge out, surrounding you.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Lake Swarm]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		You reach inside one of the pots. School of small fish suddenly surge out of the otherwise empty pot surprising you.
		<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
		<br><br>
		<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, school of small fish surged out of it." 1>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "snapper">>/* 8% */
	You reach inside one of the pots. 
	<<if $physique + $skulduggery * 3 gte $rng * 100 + 6000 and $rng isnot 100>>
		Something inside snaps at you. You pull your hand away in time, but it was close.<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
		<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, something inside it tried to snap at me." 1>>
		<br>
		<<if $deviancy gte 15 and $penisexist is 1 and $potinserts isnot undefined>>
			<br>
			You assume the creature inside is the type you're familiar with.
			<br>
			<<if $worn.genitals.type.includes("chastity")>>
				Your $worn.genitals.name prevents you from potentially inserting your <<genitals 1>> into the pot.
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[Insert your penis into the pot|Snapper Insert]]>>
					<<set $combat_partner = "snapper">>/* makes sure 1st time experience diary entries know what to say */
					<<set $timer to 7>>
					<<set $thrustdepth to 0>>
					<<wateraction>>
				<</link>><<loxygen>><<deviant2>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<ruinoptions>>
	<<elseif $physique + $skulduggery * 3 gte $rng * 50 + 4000 and $rng isnot 99>>
		Something inside snaps at you and scratches you before you get your hand out of the pot.<<gpain>><<pain 5>><<gstress>><<stress 1>>
		<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, something inside it scratched my hand." 1>>
		<br>
		<<ruinoptions>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $rng % 3 is 0>>
			Something inside snaps around your hand without letting go. Surprisingly it doesn't hurt at all but you're stuck here until you can free your hand.
		<<else>>
			Something inside snaps around your hand without letting go. It doesn't hurt much but you're stuck here until you can free your hand. <<gpain>><<pain 1>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<if $deviancy gte 35>>
			Being at this creature's mercy excites you.
			<<garousal>><<arousal 300>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			Being at this creature's mercy scares you.
			<<gstress>><<stress 300>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $oxygen lt $oxygenmax/2.9>>
			The thought of running out of air with your hand stuck stresses you.<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Struggle|Hand Snapper]]>>
			<<set $phase to 1>>
			<<set $timespent to 30 - $physique / 1000>>
			<<set $seconds += $timespent>>
			/*<<set $oxygen -= 300 - $physique / 100>>*/
			<<set $oxygen -= $timespent*10>>
		<</link>><<loxygen>>
		<br>
		<<set $rng to random(1, 100)>>
		<<link [[Wait and hope it lets you go|Hand Snapper]]>>
			<<set $phase to 2>>
			<<set $timespent to 60 - $rng / 2>>
			<<set $seconds += $timespent>>
			<<set $oxygen -= $timespent*10>>
		<</link>><<lloxygen>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "box">>/* 20% */
	You reach inside one of the pots, and find a small ivory box. It's sealed by a bronze lock.
	<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].t is "silver">>
		<<run $boxdumps.push("silver ring")>>
		<<set $phase to 1>>
	<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].t is "gold">>
		<<run $boxdumps.push("gold necklace")>>
		<<set $phase to 2>>
	<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].t is "chastity">>
		<<run $boxdumps.push("gold chastity belt")>>
		<<set $phase to 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
		The box itself is very old. It must be valuable.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Just take the box|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<run $boxdumps.pop()>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquebox" "found">><</if>>
		<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins and found a locked small ivory box in it that I took without trying to open it." 2>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
	<<link [[Open it|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it had a small locked ivory box.">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>>
	<<info "locks" "ivorybox" $skulduggerydifficulty "chance">>
	<br>
	<<if $lakeruinkey gte 1>>
		<<link [[Try to open it with bronze key|Lake Ruin Box Key]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it had a small locked ivory box.">><</link>><<loxygen>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<ruinoptions "I searched a pot in the lake ruins and found a small ivory box but I ignored it " "Leave the box and:">>/*  */
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "dust">>/* 28% */
	You reach inside one of the pots. There's purple dust at the bottom. Your probing disturbs it, and it swirls around your arm. You feel heated.
	<<gstress>><<stress 3>><<garousal>><<arousal 600>>
	<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, there was purple dust in it." 1>>
	<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "key">> /* 10% */
	<<if $lakeruinkey is undefined>>
		You reach inside one of the pots. You find a decaying bronze key.
		<<set $lakeruinkey to 1>>
		<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, there was a bronze key in it." 2>>
		<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>
	<<else>>
		You reach inside one of the pots. It's empty.
		<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was empty." 1>>
		<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>
	<</if>>
 /* 40% */
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "ceramics">> /* 20% of 40% = 8% */
	You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of broken ceramics.
	<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was empty." 1>>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "mud">>
	You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of mud.
	<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was full of mud." 1>>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "pebbles">>
	You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of pebbles.
	<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was full of pebbles." 1>>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "empty">>
	You reach inside one of the pots. It's empty.
	<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was empty." 1>>
<<else>>

<</if>>

<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].s is true>>
	 You've already searched this pot.
<<else>>
	<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].s to true>>
<</if>>


<br><br>
/*prevent ruinoptions for some events*/
<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "swarm">>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "box">>
	<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "swarm">>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "snapper">>
<<else>>
	<<ruinoptions>>
<</if>>
/* move pot to the back of array and select it*/
<<run $ruinpots.push($ruinpots[$searchpot])>>
<<run $ruinpots.deleteAt($searchpot)>>
<<set $searchpot to $ruinpots.length-1>>

<</if>>/*closes passout check*/

:: Lake Ruin Dumped Box [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

<<if $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] isnot "open">>
	<<if $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] is "silver ring">>
		<<set $phase to 1>>
	<<elseif $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] is "gold necklace">>
		<<set $phase to 2>>
	<<elseif $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] is "gold chastity belt">>
		<<set $phase to 3>>
	<</if>>
	You pick up a box that is still locked.
	<br>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
	<<link [[Open it|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I picked up a still locked discarded box in the lake ruins,">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>>
	<br>
	<<if $lakeruinkey gte 1>>
		<<link [[Try to open it with bronze key|Lake Ruin Box Key]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I picked up a still locked discarded box in the lake ruins,">><</link>><<loxygen>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<ruinoptions "I picked up a discarded box that was locked but left it " "Leave the box and:">>
<<else>>
	You take an opened old box with you. It belongs in a museum.
	<<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquebox" "found">><</if>>
	<br>
	<<run $boxdumps.pop()>>
	<<log "I picked up a discarded box in the lake ruins." 1>>
	<<ruinoptions>>
<</if>>


:: Lake Ruin Box Key [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

<<if $rng gte 4 and $phase lt 2>>/* 4% chance of key working unless the box has a gold item */
	You tried to open the box with a bronze key but it doesn't fit.<br><br>
	<<link [[Open it|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to $logprep+"">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>>
	<br>
	<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
		<<link [[Just take the box|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquebox" "found">><</if>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" I tried using the key I had on it, it didn't fit so I took the box as is.">><<log $logprep 2>><</link>>
